@Demo.Redis.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5113

### Cache-Aside 读：首次 source=db 并回填缓存，再次调用 source=cache
GET {{Demo.Redis.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 更新：先更新模拟 DB，再删除对应缓存（Cache-Aside 写策略）
PUT {{Demo.Redis.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "改名商品",
  "price": 29.9
}

### 缓存命中统计（hits / misses / entries）
GET {{Demo.Redis.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cache/stats
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{Demo.Redis.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json
